{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18909","headline":"送赵中丞自司金郎转官参山南令狐仆射幕府 · 刘禹锡","name":"送赵中丞自司金郎转官参山南令狐仆射幕府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿树满褒斜，西南蜀路赊。\n驿门临白草，县道入黄花。\n相府开油幕，门生逐绦纱。\n行看布政後，还从入京华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}